      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotia%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Western Gateway Bridge, built 1923‑25, carries Route 5 over the Mohawk River and was replaced in 1971.",
